      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK Northwest are delighted to bring this fabulous A-rated family home to market. Located on the outskirts of Tubbercurry, Co.Sligo and within walking distance of all local amenities. The property is bright, airy, beautifully decorated and ready to move in. \r\n\r\nThe exterior boasts 2 cobbled parking spaces to the front, a stunning manicured back garden with a large shed, and a rear entrance.\r\n\r\nPV Solar panels are fitted to both aspects of the roof, ensuring all-day solar gain. The solar system also includes a large battery system which returns power to the grid at night and reduces electricity bills to an absolute minimum.\r\n\r\nThe three bedrooms are spacious, and the master bedroom is ensuite with fitted wardrobes. One of the bedrooms is currently utilised as a study but could be easily reverted to a bedroom if required.\r\n\r\nTubbercurry Village: 5 min walk\r\nIreland West Airport: 20 min.\r\nSligo Town: 30 Min.\r\nCreche: 1 Min walk\r\nSchools: 5 min\r\n\r\nGas Fired Central Heating / Mains Water / Mains Sewage.\r\n\r\nHall - 2.0m x 1.6m\r\nSitting Room - 4.75m x 3.75m\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.26m x 3.17m\r\nUtility Room - 2.56m x 1.6m\r\nWC - 1.6m x 1.6m\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.80m x 3.80m\r\nEnsuite: 1.85 m x 1.66 m\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.55m x 2.43m\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.4m x 2.4m\r\nBathroom - 2.55m x 1.55m\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with the sole agent LWK Northwest.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
